1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,770
Even Yamraj is someone's brother.

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:05,132
What did his sister ask of him on Bhai Dooj?

3
00:00:05,132 --> 00:00:07,303
I am not telling this story from guesswork.

4
00:00:07,303 --> 00:00:09,070
It is written in the Skanda Purana.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,969
Even if siblings live in the same city,

6
00:00:12,969 --> 00:00:14,670
they cannot meet for months.

7
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,479
The same thing happened with Yamaraj.

8
00:00:17,479 --> 00:00:19,770
Yamuna would invite her brother every day:

9
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:21,997
[Yamuna] Brother,

10
00:00:21,997 --> 00:00:24,040
please come to my house for meals one day.

11
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,820
But Yamaraj always kept postponing.

12
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,704
[Yamraj] I'll come today,

13
00:00:28,704 --> 00:00:29,772
I'll come tomorrow,

14
00:00:29,772 --> 00:00:31,120
I'll come the day after.

15
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:34,091
Then came the second day of Kartik month.

16
00:00:34,091 --> 00:00:36,581
The sister prepared food with her own hands.

17
00:00:36,581 --> 00:00:37,940
Delighted, Yamaraj said,

18
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:40,627
[Yamraj] Yamuna,

19
00:00:40,627 --> 00:00:42,150
ask for whatever you wish.

20
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:44,440
But she only said this,

21
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:48,560
[Yamuna] come to my house for meals every year on this very day.

22
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,633
See, she didn't ask for a gift,

23
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:52,010
she wanted your time.

24
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:56,485
Send this story to your brother or sister and tell them,

25
00:00:56,485 --> 00:00:58,528
what will you give this Bhai Dooj,

26
00:00:58,528 --> 00:00:59,730
a gift or your time?

